# suite-ok
+STR
+DOC
+MAP
=VAL : unquoted
=VAL : string
=VAL : literal-block
=VAL | This entire block of text will be the value of the 'literal-block' key,\nwith line breaks being preserved.\n
=VAL : folded
=VAL > This entire block of text will be the value of 'folded', but this time, all newlines will be replaced with a single space.\n
